  "title": "Experiential ultimates are taken to be all ultimates",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "4b5ccf53-6e9e-4646-8700-326039d690af",
      "text": "The argument shows only that some ultimates are experiential. Strawson bets against such radical heterogeneity at the bottom of things, and holds that some experiential and some non-experiential ultimates would amount to a form of dualism, so he takes micropsychism to be panpsychism.",
